class: abi
profiles: standard
summary: A hand-written freestanding C peer and the program call each other under AAPCS32 on Cortex-M: every scalar width, 64-bit values in even register pairs and on the stack, layout(c) records by value and by address, small and past the four argument registers, a C function pointer to a Landin routine, a C global and a Landin datum, an unsigned plain char, a 32-bit long and an int-sized enum, each value checked where it arrives
program: program.ldn
c-sources: peer.c
c-args: -fno-short-enums
status: 42
constructs: 1570, 1580, 1600, 1610, 1975
targets: cortex-m0
